    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thumelani amawundlu kumbusi wezwe, asuke eSela, aye ehlane, entabeni yendodakazi yaseSiyoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngokuba njengenyoni ezulazulayo elahliwe esidlekeni, ayakuba njalo amadodakazi akwaMowabi ngasemifuleni yase-Arinoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Celanani, nenze ukwahlulela; yenza isithunzi sakho sibe njengobusuku phakathi nemini; fihla abaxoshwayo; Ungamkhapheli ozulazulayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaxoshiweyo bami mabahlale nawe Mowabi; ube yindawo yokucasha kubo ebusweni bomchithi; ngoba abaphangi sebephelile, umchithi uphelile, abacindezeli baphelile emhlabeni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isihlalo sobukhosi sizaqiniswa ngomusa, njalo uzahlala kuso ngeqiniso ethenteni likaDavida, efuna ukwahlulela lokulunga, esheshisa ukulunga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sizwile ngokuzidla kukaMowabi; uziqhenya kakhulu, yebo, ngokuzidla kwakhe nokuziqhenya kwakhe nolaka lwakhe, kodwa amanga akhe ngeke abe njalo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho uMowabi uyakukhala ngoMowabi, bonke bakhale; uyakulila phezu kwezisekelo zaseKiri-Haresheti; impela bashaywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngokuba amasimu aseHeshiboni abunile, nomvini waseSibima; ababusi bezizwe badiliza izithombo zawo, zaze zafika eJazeri, zazulazula ehlane; amagatsha awo aneluliwe, aphezu kolwandle.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalokho ngiyakukhala ngokukhala kukaJasheri, umvini waseSibima; ngiyakuniphuzisa, Heshiboni, nezinyembezi zami, nawe Elehale, ngokuba isikhalo sehlele izithelo zakho zasehlobo naphezu kwesivuno sakho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi intokozo isusiwe nenjabulo ensimini ecebile; nasezivinini akuyikuba khona ukuhlabelela nokujabula; Ngenze ukukhala kwabo kwakudala kuphele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalokho izibilini zami ziyakuzwakala njengensimbi kuMowabi, nezibilini zami kuze kube seKhiri-Hareshi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyakuthi lapho uMowabi ebonakala ukuthi ukhathele phezulu, uyakungena endlini yakhe engcwele ukuba akhuleke; kodwa kayikunqoba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yileli izwi uJehova alikhuluma ngoMowabi kusukela ngaleso sikhathi kuqhubeke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kepha manje uJehova wakhuluma wathi: “Phakathi neminyaka emithathu njengeminyaka yomqashwa, udumo lukaMowabi luya kudelelwa, kanye naso sonke isixuku esikhulu; futhi insali iyoba yincane kakhulu futhi ibe buthakathaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
